      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Implementation is going to be important for this, striking down an efficient use of a 2k texture would encourage unnecessary texture size inflation.\n\nI think the most optimal might be too have a VRAM budget for each level. If exceeded, increase the mip level of all textures until it fits the limit. Probably an utter pain to program. \n\nJust steal the numbers from the performance ranks, and have an option for unlimited texture",
